  "_about": "Leader pages config. One entry per person with a page: every trip leader, photographer and team member on surfyogabeer.com/squad, plus Adam Turner (not on the squad page yet). Key = the squad URL slug; 'page' = their squad page (/trip-leaders/, /photographers/, /hq/ or /management/; since Oct 31 2026 Mantas, Kaia and Shriner are on /trip-leaders/ and Sara and Danielle on /hq/, and their old /management/ addresses forward there), 'also' = another squad page of theirs that carries the same blocks. 'added' = pages added after the first 22 (Oct 16 2026); a later batch on the same day gets .2 so it takes its trip photos after the earlier pages and leaves theirs alone. 'feed' = how the leader is written in SYB HQ and the trip list (TRIPS tab, leaders column). 'aliases' = names that count as the leader in a guest review. A name two leaders share (like Sarah) only counts for the one who led a trip in that review's window. 'exclude_names' = names never quoted on any leader page (review sentences that contain them are left out). 'staff' = people whose own Google reviews are never shown as guest reviews (leaders on this list are added automatically). 'staff_first_names' = first names of other SYB leaders and staff, used to pick the review most about one leader for the big quote.",
